.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH taur-serve 1  "taur-serve " 
.SH NAME
taur\-serve \- Run the HTTP server (AUR RPC, git, snapshots, dumps, API) and optional SSH server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtaur serve\fR [\fB\-\-bind\fR] [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-ssh\-bind\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the HTTP server (AUR RPC, git, snapshots, dumps, API) and optional SSH server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-bind\fR \fI<BIND>\fR [default: 127.0.0.1:8080]

.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<HOME>\fR
Data directory (default: $TAUR_HOME, else ~/.local/share/taur)
.TP
\fB\-\-ssh\-bind\fR \fI<SSH_BIND>\fR
Also serve git over SSH on this address (e.g. 0.0.0.0:2222)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
